---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<dialog id="site-search" class="search-dialog" aria-labelledby="search-title"><div class="search-bar"><Icon name="search" size={23}/><label for="site-query" class="sr-only" id="search-title">搜索蜂巢文档</label><input id="site-query" type="search" placeholder="搜索功能、操作或技术概念…" autocomplete="off"/><button type="button" class="key-button" data-close-search aria-label="关闭搜索">Esc</button></div><div class="search-suggestions"><span>试试搜索</span><button data-search-query="工作空间">工作空间</button><button data-search-query="绑定">绑定</button><button data-search-query="开放API">开放API</button><button data-search-query="备份">备份</button></div><div id="search-results" class="search-results" aria-live="polite"><p class="search-hint">搜索产品、架构、两类操作手册与开发指南的完整正文。</p></div><div class="search-foot"><span id="search-status">所有内容均在本站检索</span><span>↑ ↓ 选择　↵ 打开</span></div></dialog>
<dialog id="image-lightbox" class="image-lightbox" aria-label="放大查看图片"><div class="lightbox-bar"><span id="lightbox-caption"></span><button type="button" class="key-button" data-close-lightbox>关闭 Esc</button></div><div class="lightbox-body"><img id="lightbox-image" alt=""/></div></dialog>
